 begin="00:10.992" end="00:14.686"><span begin="00:10.992" end="00:11.065">With </span><span begin="00:11.065" end="00:11.350">the </span><span begin="00:11.350" end="00:12.430">stereos </span><span begin="00:12.430" end="00:12.705">and </span><span begin="00:12.705" end="00:13.641">vinyls </span><span begin="00:13.641" end="00:14.086">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.686" end="00:17.334"><span begin="00:14.686" end="00:15.290">Tears </span><span begin="00:15.290" end="00:15.597">are </span><span begin="00:15.597" end="00:16.287">glistening </span><span begin="00:16.287" end="00:16.587">in </span><span begin="00:16.587" end="00:16.982">light</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.334" end="00:19.206"><span begin="00:17.334" end="00:17.607">That </span><span begin="00:17.607" end="00:17.839">feels </span><span begin="00:17.839" end="00:18.164">so </span><span begin="00:18.164" end="00:18.721">blinding</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.206" end="00:21.987"><span begin="00:19.206" end="00:19.440">I </span><span begin="00:19.440" end="00:19.635">guess </span><span begin="00:19.635" end="00:19.830">I </span><span begin="00:19.830" end="00:20.358">must </span><span begin="00:20.358" end="00:20.694">just </span><span begin="00:20.694" end="00:21.430">adjust</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.987" end="00:25.205"><span begin="00:21.987" end="00:22.263">To </span><span begin="00:22.263" end="00:22.586">a </span><span begin="00:22.586" end="00:22.871">life </span><span begin="00:22.871" end="00:23.134">with </span><span begin="00:23.134" end="00:23.359">lack </span><span begin="00:23.359" end="00:23.636">of </span><span begin="00:23.636" end="00:24.655">guidance</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.205" end="00:29.912"><span begin="00:25.205" end="00:26.342">Radio </span><span begin="00:26.342" end="00:27.079">plays </span><span begin="00:27.079" end="00:27.539">every </span><span begin="00:27.539" end="00:28.150">song </span><span begin="00:28.150" end="00:28.617">that </span><span begin="00:28.617" end="00:28.938">I </span><span begin="00:28.938" end="00:29.415">hate</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.912" end="00:35.302"><span begin="00:29.912" end="00:30.167">Cuz </span><span begin="00:30.167" end="00:30.501">I </span><span begin="00:30.501" end="00:31.490">cannot </span><span begin="00:31.490" end="00:32.545">relate </span><span begin="00:32.545" end="00:33.659">anymore</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.302" end="00:37.555"><span begin="00:35.302" end="00:35.594">Cuz </span><span begin="00:35.594" end="00:35.863">all </span><span begin="00:35.863" end="00:36.612">that </span><span begin="00:36.612" end="00:36.983">love </span><span begin="00:36.983" end="00:37.312">songs</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.555" end="00:40.211"><span begin="00:37.555" end="00:37.742">Can </span><span begin="00:37.742" end="00:37.951">do </span><span begin="00:37.951" end="00:38.263">is </span><span begin="00:38.263" end="00:39.784">remind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.211" end="00:42.940"><span begin="00:40.211" end="00:40.513">Of </span><span begin="00:40.513" end="00:40.867">when </span><span begin="00:40.867" end="00:41.156">u </span><span begin="00:41.156" end="00:41.512">were </span><span begin="00:41.512" end="00:42.359">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.940" end="00:46.439"><span begin="00:42.940" end="00:43.337">Pretend </span><span begin="00:43.337" end="00:43.758">that </span><span begin="00:43.758" end="00:44.072">I'm </span><span begin="00:44.072" end="00:45.066">fine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.439" end="00:48.316"><span begin="00:46.439" end="00:46.696">But </span><span begin="00:46.696" end="00:46.956">if </span><span begin="00:46.956" end="00:47.329">u </span><span begin="00:47.329" end="00:47.701">called </span><span begin="00:47.701" end="00:48.061">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.316" end="00:51.372"><span begin="00:48.316" end="00:48.588">I'd </span><span begin="00:48.588" end="00:48.868">run </span><span begin="00:48.868" end="00:49.253">to </span><span begin="00:49.253" end="00:49.664">the </span><span begin="00:49.664" end="00:50.620">line</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.372" end="00:53.669"><span begin="00:51.372" end="00:51.591">Pick </span><span begin="00:51.591" end="00:51.847">up </span><span begin="00:51.847" end="00:52.164">with </span><span begin="00:52.164" end="00:52.515">a </span><span begin="00:52.515" end="00:53.146">smile</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.669" end="00:59.344"><span begin="00:53.669" end="00:53.979">As </span><span begin="00:53.979" end="00:54.873">we're </span><span begin="00:54.873" end="00:57.261">intertwined</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.344" end="01:01.467"><span begin="00:59.344" end="00:59.408">Every </span><span begin="00:59.408" end="00:59.869">day </span><span begin="00:59.869" end="01:00.191">the </span><span begin="01:00.191" end="01:00.458">same </span><span begin="01:00.458" end="01:01.116">routine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.467" end="01:02.920"><span begin="01:01.467" end="01:01.845">The </span><span begin="01:01.845" end="01:02.109">songs </span><span begin="01:02.109" end="01:02.384">and </span><span begin="01:02.384" end="01:02.711">nights</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.920" end="01:05.066"><span begin="01:02.920" end="01:03.131">Between </span><span begin="01:03.131" end="01:03.506">are </span><span begin="01:03.506" end="01:03.962">long</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.066" end="01:09.382"><span begin="01:05.066" end="01:05.325">When </span><span begin="01:05.325" end="01:05.768">I </span><span begin="01:05.768" end="01:06.322">can't </span><span begin="01:06.322" end="01:06.947">sleep</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.382" end="01:12.258"><span begin="01:09.382" end="01:09.628">And </span><span begin="01:09.628" end="01:09.826">I </span><span begin="01:09.826" end="01:10.651">wrote </span><span begin="01:10.651" end="01:10.899">it </span><span begin="01:10.899" end="01:11.124">all </span><span begin="01:11.124" end="01:11.435">for </span><span begin="01:11.435" end="01:11.833">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.258" end="01:14.877"><span begin="01:12.258" end="01:12.447">And </span><span begin="01:12.447" end="01:12.647">even </span><span begin="01:12.647" end="01:12.959">though </span><span begin="01:12.959" end="01:13.582">you're </span><span begin="01:13.582" end="01:14.095">long </span><span begin="01:14.095" end="01:14.494">gone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.877" end="01:20.000"><span begin="01:14.877" end="01:15.107">I'm </span><span begin="01:15.107" end="01:15.888">writing </span><span begin="01:15.888" end="01:16.796">about </span><span begin="01:16.796" end="01:17.088">those </span><span begin="01:17.088" end="01:18.613">feelings</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.000" end="01:22.380"><span begin="01:20.000" end="01:20.239">But </span><span begin="01:20.239" end="01:20.620">the </span><span begin="01:20.620" end="01:21.308">radio </span><span begin="01:21.308" end="01:22.100">plays</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.380" end="01:25.174"><span begin="01:22.380" end="01:22.596">Every </span><span begin="01:22.596" end="01:23.493">song </span><span begin="01:23.493" end="01:23.845">that </span><span begin="01:23.845" end="01:24.206">I </span><span begin="01:24.206" end="01:24.589">hate</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.174" end="01:30.479"><span begin="01:25.174" end="01:25.444">Cuz </span><span begin="01:25.444" end="01:25.758">I </span><span begin="01:25.758" end="01:26.789">cannot </span><span begin="01:26.789" end="01:27.581">relate </span><span begin="01:27.581" end="01:28.972">anymore</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.479" end="01:32.788"><span begin="01:30.479" end="01:30.820">Cuz </span><span begin="01:30.820" end="01:31.125">all </span><span begin="01:31.125" end="01:31.784">that </span><span begin="01:31.784" end="01:32.204">love </span><span begin="01:32.204" end="01:32.550">songs</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.788" end="01:35.494"><span begin="01:32.788" end="01:33.021">Can </span><span begin="01:33.021" end="01:33.268">do </span><span begin="01:33.268" end="01:33.542">is </span><span begin="01:33.542" end="01:34.877">remind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.494" end="01:38.095"><span begin="01:35.494" end="01:35.767">Of </span><span begin="01:35.767" end="01:36.084">when </span><span begin="01:36.084" end="01:36.316">u </span><span begin="01:36.316" end="01:36.776">were </span><span begin="01:36.776" end="01:37.149">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.095" end="01:41.580"><span begin="01:38.095" end="01:38.406">Pretend </span><span begin="01:38.406" end="01:38.668">that </span><span begin="01:38.668" end="01:39.093">I'm </span><span begin="01:39.093" end="01:40.141">fine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.580" end="01:43.709"><span begin="01:41.580" end="01:41.841">But </span><span begin="01:41.841" end="01:42.093">if </span><span begin="01:42.093" end="01:42.476">u </span><span begin="01:42.476" end="01:42.820">called </span><span begin="01:42.820" end="01:43.380">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.709" end="01:46.397"><span begin="01:43.709" end="01:43.940">I'd </span><span begin="01:43.940" end="01:44.218">run </span><span begin="01:44.218" end="01:44.476">to </span><span begin="01:44.476" end="01:44.885">the </span><span begin="01:44.885" end="01:45.868">line</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.397" end="01:49.077"><span begin="01:46.397" end="01:46.689">Pick </span><span begin="01:46.689" end="01:46.911">up </span><span begin="01:46.911" end="01:47.192">with </span><span begin="01:47.192" end="01:47.488">a </span><span begin="01:47.488" end="01:47.935">smile</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.077" end="01:53.638"><span begin="01:49.077" end="01:49.308">As </span><span begin="